OL,3,GNEWSARanger's plea after deer killed in
OL,4,Adog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ranger has issued an appeal after a
OL,7,Fdeer was killed by a dog at Bradgate
OL,8,FPark.
OL,10,FMatt Smith, head ranger at the park,
OL,11,Fsaid a previously "healthy deer" was
OL,12,Ffound with its "underneath ripped out"
OL,13,Fclose to the road running through the
OL,14,Fpark on Monday morning.
OL,16,FBradgate Park Trust said in a statement
OL,17,Fit was a "heartbreaking reminder of the
OL,18,Fimportance of keeping dogs under
OL,19,Fcontrol".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
